mit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":19,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I wrote the plan for CAT-04 to `tasks/CAT-04/plan.md`. The story is marked as adopted, meaning it describes behaviour the shop already has, so the plan changes no production code and no existing test.\n\n- **Where it lives:** the Portal context serves the home page at `GET /` (`HomePageController.cs:8-9`), and the page itself is `src/DcaShop.Web/Views/Home/Index.cshtml`. The planned map and the map generated from the code both show Portal with no connections to other contexts, and the page adds no new surface.\n- **All seven scenarios are already in the code, word for word.** For each one the plan names the lines in `Index.cshtml` that produce it.\n- **None of them has a test.** The existing home-page page object only waits for the top section to load, and the tests that open `/` check nothing on the page.\n- **Levels:** the main scenario (\"the page welcomes the visitor\") gets a browser test. The other six get new HTTP-level tests in `tests/DcaShop.IntegrationTests`, written like `CatalogueTest` and `ProductPageTest`.\n- **The story is wrong about the product slider.** Its out-of-scope list says the home page has no product slider, but `Index.cshtml:11` renders one, and it is covered by tests from the earlier `product-slider` story. It doesn't block adopting CAT-04, because no scenario checks the order of the sections. That line in the backlog should be corrected through `/factory-backlog`.\n- **Other notes in the plan:**\n  - The new browser test needs a scenario with the same title in the shared specification, and a matching test in the Java suite.\n  - The Portal glossary says the home page links to checkout, but it doesn't.\n\nNo decision record was needed. I didn't run the story gate or any later stage.","ttft_ms":2748,"type":"result","duration_ms":133590,"uuid":"90654998-6d13-4f29-9918-1e4c968fb1c5","ttft_stream_ms":1878,"time_to_request_ms":48,"first_content_frame_ms":1878,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
